# M15 "Avlaklar", flow "m15_slots" run demiragiz (StartZone = 0, EnterLevel = 20, MonsterAttack = 25: the
# server's testing hooks, docs/PROTOCOL_LEVELS.md §5): a new Kargan warrior enters Demirağız at level 20 with
# 57 unspent points (left unspent: the stored level is raised only by the next save), walks out to the two new slot kinds of the Kargan homeland:
# Körük Çukuru 1 (Buzul Körükçü, levels 5-7, the east basin) and Örs Meydanı 1 (Örs Kıran, 8-10, the
# south-west basin). At each: the slot's name line under the zone name (approach), the fight, the kill.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m15_demiragiz
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Korukcu
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone3+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600
expect world+level20+unspent57
# ---- Körük Çukuru 1: Buzul Körükçü (5-7) ----
scene walkpath 332.6 232.7
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
expect world+slot+slot_demiragiz_koruk_1
expecttext world.slotname Körük Çukuru 1 · Sv. 5-7
scene walktomonster Buzul Körükçü 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 07_koruk_approach.png
scene target nearest Buzul Körükçü
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
scene camera side 24 6
wait 6
screenshot 08_koruk_fight.png
waitfor world+kills1 2400
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 28 6
wait 5
screenshot 09_koruk_kill.png
# ---- Örs Meydanı 1: Örs Kıran (8-10) ----
key escape
scene walkpath 256 185
waitfor world+nodest+standing 4800
scene walkpath 180.5 176
waitfor world+nodest+standing 4800
scene expectnear 180.5 176 3
waitfor world+alive 600
expect world+slot+slot_demiragiz_ors_1
expecttext world.slotname Örs Meydanı 1 · Sv. 8-10
scene walktomonster Örs Kıran 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 10_ors_approach.png
scene target nearest Örs Kıran
key f
waitfor world+attacking+incombat 900
wait 30
scene camera side 26 7
wait 6
screenshot 11_ors_fight.png
waitfor world+kills2 3000
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 30 7
wait 5
screenshot 12_ors_kill.png
quit
